### 2. Strict Restrictions & Prohibitions
By viewing, cloning, checking out, downloading, or inspecting this repository, you enter into a legally binding agreement adhering to the following strict prohibitions without prior, express, and written authorization from the copyright owners:

1. **No Execution or Deployment**: You may not compile, build, run, host, deploy, or execute the A.E.G.I.S. platform (including the Flutter mobile app, FastAPI backend, live audio streaming pipelines, WebSocket services, or background daemons) on any public or private server (such as AWS, GCP, Azure, Oracle Cloud, Render, Docker containers, VPS, or local environments) for active call monitoring or operational use.
2. **No Code Copying or Plagiarism**: You may not copy, duplicate, clone, replicate, hotlink, republish, or paste any portion of this codebase, algorithms, API endpoints, schema definitions, DSP algorithms, or database structures.
3. **No Derivative Works or Forks**: You may not create, compile, distribute, publish, or sublicense any derivative works, modified builds, forks, plugins, or complementary extensions derived from this codebase.
4. **No Pipeline or Model Integration**: You may not extract or integrate any subcomponents of A.E.G.I.S.—including the AASIST graph neural network model weights/loaders, Sarvam STT pipeline wrappers, WebRTC VAD audio chunkers, regex intent scanners, or PDF forensic report generators—into third-party applications, commercial bots, security products, or API gateways.
5. **No Commercial Exploitation**: You may not sell, lease, rent, license, sub-license, commercialize, or use this software, models, or documentation to generate direct or indirect revenue.
6. **No Asset or UI Theft**: You may not reuse any visual assets, logos, risk radar gauges, waveform widgets, design systems, UI components, animations, color palettes, or branding elements created for A.E.G.I.S.
7. **No Reverse Engineering or Penetration Attacks**: You may not reverse-engineer, decompile, disassemble, or extract weights/parameters from the models, backend services, or mobile client. You are strictly forbidden from performing penetration testing, vulnerability scanning, fuzzing, or DDoS/DoS simulations against active A.E.G.I.S. infrastructure.
8. **No AI / LLM Model Training**: This codebase, including all source files, documentation, model architectures, datasets, and comments, must not be used as training inputs, fine-tuning corpora, or scraped to train Large Language Models (LLMs), code synthesis agents, developer assistants, or generative AI models without written consent.
9. **No Unauthorized Academic Submission**: Under no circumstances may this project, in whole or in part, be submitted as original work for academic credit, thesis evaluation, hackathons, grading, or certification at any university, college, school, or educational boot camp without explicit prior written authorization from the copyright owners.

